A deploy

Write the story `deploy`: the `Engineer` acts on `GitHub` with the label
`merge`, `GitHub` calls `CI` with the label `start`, `CI` sends to the
`Registry` with the label `push`, and `Argo` reads from the `Registry` with the
label `pull`. Show it as a sequence.
---
story deploy {
  Engineer -> GitHub: merge
  GitHub -> CI: start
  CI -> Registry: push
  Argo -> Registry: pull
}
show sequence of deploy
